# GitHub Linguist: language stats / LOC come from the shipping code in src/ only.
# Everything else (docs website, Research spikes, Examples, Playground, Tests,
# scripts, CI) is vendored so it doesn't skew the repo's language breakdown.
* linguist-vendored
src/** -linguist-vendored

# Even inside src/: minified assets and markdown are not package code.
*.min.js  linguist-vendored
*.min.css linguist-vendored
*.md      linguist-documentation
